W: 1 O strength and stay upholding all creation,
W: who ever dost thyself unmoved abide,
W: yet day by day the light in due gradation
W: from hour to hour through all its changes guide;
W:
W: 2 Grant to life&apos;s day a calm unclouded ending,
W: an eve untouched by shadows of decay,
W: the brightness of a holy death-bed blending
W: with dawning glories of the eternal day.
W:
W: 3 Hear us, O Father, gracious and forgiving,
W: through Jesus Christ thy co-eternal Word,
W: who with the Holy Ghost by all things living
W: now and to endless ages art adored.
W:</miscellaneous-field>
